    whatIsHappening: "John the Baptist appears in the wilderness calling Israel to repentance and baptism, warning that the one coming after him will baptise with the Holy Spirit and fire. Jesus comes to be baptised, and as he rises from the water the Spirit descends and the Father speaks — the Trinity present at the launch of Jesus's public ministry. The Spirit immediately drives Jesus into the desert for forty days of fasting and three face-to-face temptations by Satan, all of which Jesus defeats with scripture. Jesus then begins his Galilean ministry, calling his first disciples — fishermen who leave their nets on the spot.",
